# Nothing reaches the image build unless it is named here: the config, the database and
# its copies, statements, output, personal rules, internal docs, tests and caches all stay
# out, and so does whatever is added to the folder later.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!src/**

# Inside src: what is not source.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store

# Never, wherever they turn up.
**/finanze.yaml
**/rules.local.yaml
**/rules.*.yaml
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
